# Contracts

`packages/contracts` is the only shared type package.

- Export Zod schemas and inferred types for SessionEvent, Intent, FileMap, AgentJob, AgentResult
- Apps import from `@terrarium/contracts` — never copy DTOs into `apps/web` or `apps/api`
- Do not import Docker, LLM SDKs, React, or Fastify here
